  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade-Related Training Program - GLOBAL CUSTOMS MODERNIZATION INITIATIVE, through Macro International</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding of $1 million supports a worldwide global customs training initiative, a proactive public-private partnership to address critical customs training requirements in developing and middle income countries. This initiative includes a series of senior-level policy dialogues, global training workshops, and project definition activities to advance customs modernization in areas including chain security, port and cargo security, intellectual property rights enforcement, anti-counterfeiting and anti-piracy measures, customs valuation, rules of origin, and compliance with bilateral and multilateral trade agreements.</narrative>
  </description>
